      "source": "this builder.",
      "translation": "此构建器。",
      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a> that is provieded through\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/DefaultContentTypeResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>DefaultContentTypeResolver</code></a> to message converters when using\n<a href=\"#registerDefaults(boolean)\"><code>default registrations</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/util/MimeType.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.util\"><code>MimeType</code></a> 提供的默认 MIME 类型，以便在使用 <a href=\"#registerDefaults(boolean)\"><code>默认注册</code></a> 时，消息转换器能够应用该设置。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/StringMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>StringMessageConverter</code></a> with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/charset/Charset.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.charset\"><code>Charset</code></a>.",
      "translation": "配置一个使用给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/nio/charset/Charset.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.nio.charset\"><code>Charset</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/StringMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>StringMessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to use for <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> payloads.",
      "translation": "配置用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/String.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>String</code></a> 负载。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to the composite converter.",
      "translation": "向复合转换器添加自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.messaging.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Build the final <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "构建最终的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Note that generic serializers may support a broad range of objects and <a href=\"SerializerMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>SerializerMessageConverter</code></a> should\nbe configured with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/AbstractMessageConverter.html#setContentTypeResolver(org.springframework.messaging.converter.ContentTypeResolver)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>content type resolution</code></a> support to ensure it only applies to messages (endpoints) with supported content types.",
      "translation": "请注意，通用序列化器可能支持多种对象类型，因此应将 <a href=\"SerializerMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>SerializerMessageConverter</code></a> 配置为支持<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/AbstractMessageConverter.html#setContentTypeResolver(org.springframework.messaging.converter.ContentTypeResolver)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>内容类型解析</code></a>，以确保它仅适用于具有支持内容类型的消息（端点）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<small>Copyright © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>. All rights reserved.</small>",
      "translation": "<small>版权所有 © 2011–2026 <a href=\"https://www.spring.io\">Pivotal Software, Inc.</a>。保留所有权利。</small>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If multiple converters are configured or default converters are registered, this returns a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/CompositeMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>CompositeMessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果配置了多个转换器或注册了默认转换器，则返回一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/CompositeMessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>CompositeMessageConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Defaults to <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "默认为<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to the composite converter using the given <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> to use\nSpring Data Redis' <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> for specific serializers such.",
      "translation": "向复合转换器添加自定义<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>，使用给定的<a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a>来利用 Spring Data Redis 的<a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a>处理特定序列化器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A builder for configuring a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "用于配置 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.messaging.converter 中的类或接口\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> 的构建器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure whether to register default converters.",
      "translation": "配置是否注册默认转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "the constructed <a href=\"RedisMessageConverters.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisMessageConverters</code></a>.",
      "translation": "构建的<a href=\"RedisMessageConverters.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.serializer 中的接口\"><code>RedisMessageConverters</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>defaultMimeType</code> - the default mime type to use for converters that support content type resolution.",
      "translation": "<code>defaultMimeType</code> - 用于支持内容类型解析的转换器的默认 MIME 类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>registerDefaults</code> - whether to register default converters",
      "translation": "<code>registerDefaults</code> - 是否注册默认转换器",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>stringMessageConverter</code> - the converter to use",
      "translation": "<code>stringMessageConverter</code> - 要使用的转换器",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>charset</code> - the charset to use for string conversion",
      "translation": "<code>charset</code> - 用于字符串转换的字符集",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>serializer</code> - the custom converter to add.",
      "translation": "<code>serializer</code> - 要添加的自定义转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>converter</code> - the custom converter to add.",
      "translation": "<code>converter</code> - 要添加的自定义转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Ilyass Bougati, Mark Paluch",
      "translation": "伊利亚斯·布加蒂，马克·帕卢赫",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure whether to register default converters. Register default converters using classpath detection. Manual\nregistrations of <a href=\"#withStringConverter(org.springframework.messaging.converter.MessageConverter)\"><code>withStringConverter(MessageConverter)</code></a> will override auto-detected string converters.",
      "translation": "配置是否注册默认转换器。使用类路径检测来注册默认转换器。手动注册的<a href=\"#withStringConverter(org.springframework.messaging.converter.MessageConverter)\"><code>withStringConverter(MessageConverter)</code></a>将覆盖自动检测到的字符串转换器。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a> to the composite converter using the given <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> to use\nSpring Data Redis' <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> for specific serializers such.\n<a href=\"JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JDK serialization</code></a>.",
      "translation": "向复合转换器添加自定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/messaging/converter/MessageConverter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.messaging.converter\"><code>MessageConverter</code></a>，并使用给定的 <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a> 来利用 Spring Data Redis 的 <a href=\"RedisSerializer.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>RedisSerializer</code></a>，以处理特定序列化器（例如 <a href=\"JdkSerializationRedisSerializer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.serializer\"><code>JDK serialization</code></a>）。",
      "count": 1
    }
  ]
